[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993389141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107793#issuecomment-2993389141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107793","id":2993389141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ya35V","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T07:14:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T07:14:44Z","body":"related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106902","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993389141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993457282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107793#issuecomment-2993457282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107793","id":2993457282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybIiC","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T08:21:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T08:21:38Z","body":"Hi, @jinyangcruise \nThank you for opening this issue to track the forward compatibility issue. Let us continue the discussion here.\n\nAs for why the change, We discussed this in two core meetings, and we agreed that the current course of action (breaking forward compatibility) would lead to more maintainable code. Godot's version policy technically only guarantees backward compatibility.\n\nAs a result of this change, any .import or other config file with a hard external resource reference cannot be read by an old version of Godot. As a workaround, it is possible to embed the resource (make local) if you intend to share the files with an older version.\n\nJust to lay everything on the table, I do have code to enable forward and backward compatibility by using lines starting with =, which are currently ignored in ConfigFile, but it leads to more code and hence more technical debt and hence the consensus at the meeting was not to do this version of the change. You can see it in the PR history if you are curious.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993457282/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993464538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107793#issuecomment-2993464538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107793","id":2993464538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybKTa","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T08:39:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T08:39:28Z","body":"OK, that's sounds reasonable.\n\nDo you know how to embed a resource into a ConfigFile?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993464538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993469990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107793#issuecomment-2993469990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107793","id":2993469990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybLom","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T08:53:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T08:53:12Z","body":"If you create a new object of some type, for example, on the Skeleton3D node of the advanced importer, creating a new BoneMap and SkeletonProfileHumanoid will be embedded ising the Resource( ... ) or Object( ... ) syntax in the .import file. \n\nFor files you load, for example a T-Pose rest animation for skeleton retargeting, after loading the animation file in the advanced importer dialog inspector, you should be able to open the dropdown and choose Make Local just like the normal godot inspector. This will embed the whole resource in text form, so it is not good for a very large animation, texture or mesh data but otherwise could be a viable workflow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993469990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993472206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107793#issuecomment-2993472206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107793","id":2993472206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybMLO","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T08:59:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T08:59:09Z","body":"Thanks, do you know how to embed a resource not relying on the engine's UI but code?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993472206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"con